      <graphic xml:id="m-67fec981-f0d3-46ec-b772-8450da8cea32" target="0833_original_image.tiff" /><zone xml:id="m-8ae0fae5-d502-4f9e-92d7-15945ab33051" ulx="302" uly="140" lrx="1427" lry="196" /><zone xml:id="m-80d7723b-c98f-4f2d-ba9a-cdae6d12ff76" ulx="1543" uly="147" lrx="1658" lry="205" /><zone xml:id="m-624e239f-f3e2-4598-a17e-dc866d5171fd" ulx="95" uly="230" lrx="1660" lry="291" /><zone xml:id="m-9d4e5c18-c677-47b5-8998-f3f54888ab91" ulx="40" uly="280" lrx="1658" lry="344" /><zone xml:id="m-bc47f476-3329-4541-9729-33d18367fcd7" ulx="44" uly="327" lrx="1093" lry="381" /><zone xml:id="m-26318000-0298-4f2d-9e9a-1b330ae403d7" ulx="758" uly="419" lrx="954" lry="482" /><zone xml:id="m-5ceb6522-d924-4594-b54f-dee3b0c27751" ulx="57" uly="476" lrx="1662" lry="554" /><zone xml:id="m-dcba3c65-284e-4aa8-8637-230c59d2c8d1" ulx="854" uly="534" lrx="1660" lry="597" /><zone xml:id="m-fb77da84-a466-4739-9744-556cc3e6a2c3" ulx="59" uly="536" lrx="840" lry="595" /><zone xml:id="m-30dcaaf0-2597-4329-9181-59ad87386930" ulx="44" uly="590" lrx="1665" lry="655" /><zone xml:id="m-ba571b83-f7b5-48f3-aebd-1a3de3eef9b6" ulx="44" uly="648" lrx="1239" lry="707" /><zone xml:id="m-482695e1-b068-43b2-b1cc-65f08df14e10" ulx="45" uly="699" lrx="852" lry="772" /><zone xml:id="m-003d40d8-bffd-4863-a3eb-a734777e9e2c" ulx="95" uly="777" lrx="1665" lry="840" /><zone xml:id="m-568d28b4-0b00-4206-b34b-380629ec2bc6" ulx="44" uly="826" lrx="1665" lry="887" /><zone xml:id="m-5cff42a8-9d72-4c8c-aa11-e7c6f9ff46a8" ulx="44" uly="874" lrx="1665" lry="933" /><zone xml:id="m-3a456d57-0e60-4daf-811f-a23a7cbb10bb" ulx="44" uly="921" lrx="1392" lry="982" /><zone xml:id="m-997eb30a-3cce-4d95-ba8e-0af5b9f59457" ulx="108" uly="1042" lrx="1665" lry="1108" /><zone xml:id="m-e379adaa-e40a-4331-90a3-5f2c2fc095ef" ulx="42" uly="1096" lrx="560" lry="1147" /><zone xml:id="m-b726ee77-4e5f-4a08-9724-6c500e5a1add" ulx="98" uly="1162" lrx="1648" lry="1230" /><zone xml:id="m-a42d4344-f2b8-4a43-8973-1c9ab644fc23" ulx="95" uly="1252" lrx="528" lry="1311" /><zone xml:id="m-07debb07-45b0-4813-a090-774bedbcbd39" ulx="677" uly="1315" lrx="1030" lry="1374" /><zone xml:id="m-935c0011-099d-47f2-a182-3384397c5e1f" ulx="98" uly="1398" lrx="1663" lry="1474" /><zone xml:id="m-84d1a353-33b8-406d-b9f7-b2812397a647" ulx="45" uly="1456" lrx="994" lry="1527" /><zone xml:id="m-3e88cffc-0478-46a7-aec6-91d1abd40abe" ulx="714" uly="1571" lrx="994" lry="1642" /><zone xml:id="m-a00a3fc8-5de7-4278-a346-3475956fa97a" ulx="101" uly="1658" lrx="1665" lry="1737" /><zone xml:id="m-a787713a-4009-4fc8-bb3c-3ff9c74d3360" ulx="52" uly="1717" lrx="1000" lry="1792" /><zone xml:id="m-208651e3-f73e-44c0-aaef-47bd90950315" ulx="96" uly="1788" lrx="1647" lry="1863" /><zone xml:id="m-ce354038-f543-4e37-be3c-9a1c99e52bf9" ulx="181" uly="2875" lrx="453" lry="2941" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-3f7100f6-a59e-46cb-bf59-7e6e8497d8e0" n="0833" facs="#m-1fce9d4b-1561-4404-83fa-5d938899be88" /><div xml:id="m-aa4b916a-8f10-4159-b8b9-b02fe755d626">
            <lg xml:id="m-01a7262f-753d-450c-8da0-b4830c65688e">
              <l xml:id="m-b1dd54df-d71f-46c8-b661-bd6c5337fd0c" facs="#m-8ae0fae5-d502-4f9e-92d7-15945ab33051" label="text-like">The Translation of the Blessed Sacrament</l><l xml:id="m-18f9cf3b-e394-47b0-ab4f-e56a8f2b141d" facs="#m-80d7723b-c98f-4f2d-ba9a-cdae6d12ff76" label="ambiguous">687</l><l xml:id="m-6934e8cf-f4f9-44b5-b200-bb3f2c3bc1df" facs="#m-624e239f-f3e2-4598-a17e-dc866d5171fd" label="text-like">Then the Pater noster, in silence throughout, and afterwards the following</l><l xml:id="m-e4880e56-dffe-4e48-8cc0-bf7e00d7dba6" facs="#m-9d4e5c18-c677-47b5-8998-f3f54888ab91" label="lyrics-like">Collect without Orémus, which is said in a clear voice with the dropo</l><l xml:id="m-f77f0f82-1511-41e1-bdf8-5327f8c51030" facs="#m-bc47f476-3329-4541-9729-33d18367fcd7" label="text-like">a whole tone on the last syllable, as in the psalms.</l><l xml:id="m-c91875e3-a7a4-4079-9062-268c3702478d" facs="#m-26318000-0298-4f2d-9e9a-1b330ae403d7" label="text-like">Prayer</l><l xml:id="m-799c5784-95b4-472c-94e4-7bee7c28f427" facs="#m-5ceb6522-d924-4594-b54f-dee3b0c27751" label="lyrics-like">VVIsita, quaésumus, Dómine, custódiant; et benedíctio tua</l><l xml:id="m-d106d4cc-bef0-4519-ba10-d367783c6ae6" facs="#m-dcba3c65-284e-4aa8-8637-230c59d2c8d1" label="text-like">sit super nos semper. But Per</l><l xml:id="m-50590927-9802-4de7-b51d-006283413623" facs="#m-fb77da84-a466-4739-9744-556cc3e6a2c3" label="lyrics-like">habitatiónem istam, et om¬</l><l xml:id="m-47d04914-70c1-4a78-a26a-88bd92489153" facs="#m-30dcaaf0-2597-4329-9181-59ad87386930" label="lyrics-like">nes insídias inimíci ab ea longe Dóminum is said in silence, and</l><l xml:id="m-72301a70-edb2-4cad-a927-d2264775cda8" facs="#m-ba571b83-f7b5-48f3-aebd-1a3de3eef9b6" label="lyrics-like">repélle: Angeli tui sancti há-ten all depart.</l><l xml:id="m-aab47bf7-904f-4442-b4c3-35dff1e64ea5" facs="#m-482695e1-b068-43b2-b1cc-65f08df14e10" label="ambiguous">bitent in ea, qui nos in pace</l><l xml:id="m-a8604499-e9f8-47b4-b73d-22003f967154" facs="#m-003d40d8-bffd-4863-a3eb-a734777e9e2c" label="text-like">10. Public adoration of the Blessed Sacrament takes place at the altar of</l><l xml:id="m-0ac65b31-2728-4dc0-99f2-8cbddb13ff37" facs="#m-568d28b4-0b00-4206-b34b-380629ec2bc6" label="lyrics-like">Repose from the end of the Mass in Cena Dómini. It should continue at</l><l xml:id="m-d9761c55-cbc8-4b3c-aa8a-2af1560c0584" facs="#m-5cff42a8-9d72-4c8c-aa11-e7c6f9ff46a8" label="text-like">least until midnight, when the memory of Our Lord’s passion and death tabes</l><l xml:id="m-99f6b5c2-105c-4d0a-8d67-167d267e75ac" facs="#m-3a456d57-0e60-4daf-811f-a23a7cbb10bb" label="text-like">the place of the liturgical commemoration of the Holy Eucharist.</l><l xml:id="m-93271e36-c738-441b-82ad-f11b62b642c8" facs="#m-997eb30a-3cce-4d95-ba8e-0af5b9f59457" label="text-like">In private recitation Vespers are said as on Holy Saturday, p. 776c,</l><l xml:id="m-a61c7fc3-15c8-4a19-a6e6-f71bda075e06" facs="#m-e379adaa-e40a-4331-90a3-5f2c2fc095ef" label="text-like">except for what folloros:</l><l xml:id="m-10b1721d-f443-4574-85ee-42ab280f6854" facs="#m-b726ee77-4e5f-4a08-9724-6c500e5a1add" label="lyrics-like">Ant. 7. Cálicem salutáris accípiam, et nomen Dómini invocábo.</l><l xml:id="m-5797ca04-52df-4554-b9fc-23c2c7540fc4" facs="#m-a42d4344-f2b8-4a43-8973-1c9ab644fc23" label="text-like">Ant. at Magnificat.</l><l xml:id="m-35bc1d17-578b-4f03-a08a-7e93811d7ca2" facs="#m-07debb07-45b0-4813-a090-774bedbcbd39" label="text-like">on Thursday</l><l xml:id="m-98c002c2-69f1-40f9-aaa7-185191ee2706" facs="#m-935c0011-099d-47f2-a182-3384397c5e1f" label="lyrics-like">Cenántibus autem illis, ac-lac fregit, dedítque discipulis</l><l xml:id="m-2dc5068c-56e8-4da1-9cdc-596a654caf65" facs="#m-84d1a353-33b8-406d-b9f7-b2812397a647" label="lyrics-like">cépit Jesus panem, et benedixit, suis.</l><l xml:id="m-7f070d31-da1e-454b-a1c1-93a05666279b" facs="#m-3e88cffc-0478-46a7-aec6-91d1abd40abe" label="text-like">On Friday</l><l xml:id="m-2b3e83b0-4980-442c-bad0-7921cd76dd7a" facs="#m-a00a3fc8-5de7-4278-a346-3475956fa97a" label="lyrics-like">Cum accepísset acétum, * di-inclináto cápite, emísit spíri¬</l><l xml:id="m-0fea9c74-5d13-42e6-8372-d4843052d976" facs="#m-a787713a-4009-4fc8-bb3c-3ff9c74d3360" label="lyrics-like">xit: Consummátum est: et tum.</l><l xml:id="m-5c65af60-abbb-4975-a831-ba1d97bc9533" facs="#m-208651e3-f73e-44c0-aaef-47bd90950315" label="text-like">Then the Ant. Christus factus est. and what follows as at Lauds, p. 659.</l><l xml:id="m-b2e7c104-e78f-489e-8ed5-b289afa198b4" facs="#m-ce354038-f543-4e37-be3c-9a1c99e52bf9" label="ambiguous">N°sol. — 27</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>